commit 7263115cf192eaa8f066e53e0b34773cab84f242
Author:     Alessandro Castellani <alessandro@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Thu Apr 9 17:34:08 2026 +0100
Commit:     Alessandro Castellani <alessandro@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Thu Apr 9 17:34:08 2026 +0100

    Bug 2029036 - Simplify cards view colors, clean up duplicate styles, and consume a few more --color-surface tokens. r=Paenglab,rtaylor


    - Introducing a series of `--sidebar-*` variables to consume the Theme variables and have fallback defaults in one single place.
    - Unified the style of rollover, active, and focus for the folder pane and message list, matching the same style across Mail tab and Address book tab.
    - In dark mode, the message list background goes full black instead of dark grey, for better visual balance.
    - All the lists hover, select, and focus effects use the same opacity values based on transparency instead of arbitrary grey colors.
    - Changed the style of creation buttons for the address book edit panel.
    - Removed multiple duplicate styles across files.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291932

